# Description: On-demand todo_md task management and planning/implementation prompts
$ todo_md --agents
[if role=plan]
$ todo_md
prompt Once we agree on task <ID> in TODO.md, initialize a new session bundle for task=<ID> with a task prompt and relevant files.
[/if]
[if task!=]
[if task=next] $ todo_md
[if task!=,next] $ todo_md {task:}
[if task=next] prompt Mode: IMPLEMENTATION (task=next). Inspect the relevant files and propose an implementation plan for the top [WIP] or [NEXT] task in TODO.md.
[if task!=,next] prompt Mode: IMPLEMENTATION (task={task:}). Inspect the relevant files and propose an implementation plan for task {task:}.
[/if]
